So what should you do?

1570
01:20:32,446 --> 01:20:34,646
If you hit it short, they'll block.

1571
01:20:34,646 --> 01:20:36,346
Aim deep and spike.

1572
01:20:37,846 --> 01:20:39,380
See the wing over there?

1573
01:20:39,380 --> 01:20:40,746
- Just hit it that way.
- Okay.

1574
01:20:41,646 --> 01:20:42,780
- Let's go!
- Let's go!

1575
01:20:43,246 --> 01:20:44,146
Chae Rim!

1576
01:20:44,580 --> 01:20:45,546
(Their block is low.)

1577
01:20:45,546 --> 01:20:46,780
(If you hit it short, they'll block.)

1578
01:20:46,780 --> 01:20:47,946
(Aim deep and spike.)

1579
01:20:49,480 --> 01:20:51,546
The score is 10 to 11,
