1585
01:21:06,180 --> 01:21:07,146
Seung Ju saves it.

1586
01:21:07,480 --> 01:21:09,213
- Back toss.
- Yes, that's right.

1587
01:21:09,213 --> 01:21:10,280
They push it over.

1588
01:21:10,280 --> 01:21:11,480
(Shujitsu's chance)

1589
01:21:12,146 --> 01:21:14,246
(Into multiple-attack mode again)

1590
01:21:14,446 --> 01:21:15,880
Who will they pass to this time?

1591
01:21:16,380 --> 01:21:18,080
(Confused)

1592
01:21:18,080 --> 01:21:19,446
- Number one.
- Number one.

1593
01:21:19,913 --> 01:21:20,813
No, left.

1594
01:21:21,113 --> 01:21:22,246
- Number one!
- Number one!

1595
01:21:22,880 --> 01:21:23,913
No, left.

1596
01:21:25,046 --> 01:21:27,046
(Got it right again.
To the left, player number six.)

1597
01:21:27,046 --> 01:21:28,080
Spike!

1598
01:21:28,080 --> 01:21:30,413
(They got the direction
