1600
01:21:33,546 --> 01:21:35,713
- Su Bin's dig.
- Cover!

1601
01:21:38,046 --> 01:21:39,213
Right. Okay.

1602
01:21:40,980 --> 01:21:42,046
Gosh, please.

1603
01:21:42,046 --> 01:21:43,546
Hit it!

1604
01:21:43,546 --> 01:21:44,513
Chae Rim spikes!

1605
01:21:48,313 --> 01:21:50,180
(Libero Senba Kokoro's dig)

1606
01:21:50,180 --> 01:21:52,013
The libero receives!

1607
01:21:52,480 --> 01:21:54,146
It's a libero battle!

1608
01:21:55,180 --> 01:21:57,280
(Receives it with fast reflexes)

1609
01:21:58,613 --> 01:21:59,780
Center-back attack.

1610
01:21:59,780 --> 01:22:01,546
Su Bin receives!

1611
01:22:02,146 --> 01:22:03,980
- Cover!
- Great job!

1612
01:22:05,413 --> 01:22:07,346
(Cover Queen, Su Bin)

1613
01:22:07,346 --> 01:22:08,513
Hit it, please!

1614
01:22:11,346 --> 01:22:12,546
Watch out!

1615
01:22:13,580 --> 01:22:15,053
(Deep breath)

1616
01:22:15,165 --> 01:22:16,065
Chae Rim!

1617
01:22:16,546 --> 01:22:20,313
