- No one's there.

1641
01:23:31,895 --> 01:23:34,562
It's a chance! Watch it and get it!

1642
01:23:34,962 --> 01:23:36,162
That's it!

1643
01:23:36,162 --> 01:23:38,083
(Never miss a free ball!)

1644
01:23:38,829 --> 01:23:40,495
It's a chance for them
to turn the game around!

1645
01:23:40,495 --> 01:23:42,795
Young In's spike!

1646
01:23:42,795 --> 01:23:44,362
(Young In's game-changing spike)

1647
01:23:52,162 --> 01:23:53,629
Way to go!

1648
01:23:53,630 --> 01:23:56,167
(Thrilling comeback)

1649
01:23:56,932 --> 01:23:59,332
(We've caught the momentum now!)

1650
01:24:02,366 --> 01:24:04,099
Great!

1651
01:24:04,099 --> 01:24:06,966
- Thank you.
- That was nice.

1652
01:24:08,432 --> 01:24:11,463
(Thanks to the rookie coach's judgment,)

1653
01:24:12,692 --> 01:24:16,425
(their right attack is on fire.)

1654
01:24:18,232 --> 01:24:19,366
Na Yeon, good job!

1655
01:24:21,366 --> 01:24:24,399
The Wonder Dogs turn the game around
once again.

1656
01:24:24,399 --> 01:24:25,399
The score is 11 to 12.

1657
01:24:29,199 --> 01:24:32,189
Overall, they demonstrated on the court...

1658
01:24:32,190 --> 01:24:35,199
what we discussed in the meeting...

1659
01:24:35,199 --> 01:24:37,699
and delivered a great performance.

1660
01:24:38,232 --> 01:24:40,232
You've got great serves!

1661
01:24:41,898 --> 01:24:45,032
(Riding the momentum,
Seung Ju will serve.)

1662
01:24:47,282 --> 01:24:50,116
(Clean service ace!)

1663
01:24:51,324 --> 01:24:54,916
- Great!
- Point from Seung Ju's serve!

1664
01:24:54,916 --> 01:24:56,416
(Consecutive points scored.)

1665
01:24:57,316 --> 01:25:00,482
Seung Ju is always strong
in matches against Japan.

1666
01:25:01,116 --> 01:25:03,016
The Wonder Dogs now take a two-point lead.

1667
01:25:04,449 --> 01:25:07,449
(The score difference is two points now.)

1668
01:25:08,049 --> 01:25:09,749
To zone one!

1669
01:25:12,382 --> 01:25:14,149
(Received it!)

1670
01:25:18,137 --> 01:25:19,849
- Block in the middle.
- That's nice.

1671
01:25:20,249 --> 01:25:21,249
(After hitting the wailing wall,)

1672
01:25:21,249 --> 01:25:23,816
(it's a free ball.)

1673
01:25:24,282 --> 01:25:25,282
Young In.

1674
01:25:25,649 --> 01:25:26,749
Close to the net!

1675
01:25:27,349 --> 01:25:29,182
(Let's go, Young In!)

1676
01:25:30,649 --> 01:25:33,282
- Hit it!
- Smash!

1677
01:25:33,282 --> 01:25:35,116
(Will the cheering
of the Shujitsu supporters stay quiet?)

1678
01:25:36,649 --> 01:25:37,982
Young In's spike!

1679
01:25:38,249 --> 01:25:40,482
She nailed it!

1680
01:25:41,349 --> 01:25:42,716
(Sighing instead of cheering)

1681
01:25:43,349 --> 01:25:44,482
(Na Yeon and Young In's perfect combo)

1682
01:25:44,482 --> 01:25:46,716
Thank you!

1683
01:25:47,149 --> 01:25:49,849
Wait. This is when we need to get ready
to cover the ball.

1684
01:25:50,782 --> 01:25:53,416
(The Wonder Dogs gain momentum.)

1685
01:25:58,682 --> 01:26:02,782
(I thought their defense was weak.)

1686
01:26:03,351 --> 01:26:07,727
(The nightmarish wailing wall)

1687
01:26:08,582 --> 01:26:12,782
(Before the game,
they anticipated a 3-to-0 victory.)

1688
01:26:13,816 --> 01:26:17,016
(But the game is going
toward a 0-to-3 defeat.)

1689
01:26:22,016 --> 01:26:23,182
(Gather around.)

1690
01:26:23,616 --> 01:26:26,049
(Timeout for Shujitsu High School)

1691
01:26:26,516 --> 01:26:28,282
Even if you lose the game,

1692
01:26:30,916 --> 01:26:31,916
