1694
01:26:41,549 --> 01:26:44,616
That one point was extremely important.

1695
01:26:45,316 --> 01:26:47,282
Our ace is struggling.

1696
01:26:52,916 --> 01:27:00,616
And you're not even using light feints.

1697
01:27:01,282 --> 01:27:02,716
(The rally from earlier)

1698
01:27:03,082 --> 01:27:05,649
(They could've scored with a soft feint.)

1699
01:27:06,149 --> 01:27:07,582
(But they chose to spike.)

1700
01:27:08,182 --> 01:27:10,549
All they do is hit the ball hard.

1701
01:27:11,082 --> 01:27:17,482
(The plan to crumble the wailing wall:
Soft feints)

1702
01:27:17,482 --> 01:27:18,916
- In 1, 2, 3.
- Let's go!

1703
01:27:23,416 --> 01:27:31,182
(Shujitsu High needs
to steal the momentum,)

1704
01:27:33,049 --> 01:27:35,916
