to maintain it.)

1705
01:27:35,916 --> 01:27:37,682
Myoung Hwa, position one!

1706
01:27:38,949 --> 01:27:41,816
(Play resumes with Seung Ju's serve.)

1707
01:27:43,482 --> 01:27:44,949
(Receiving safely...)

1708
01:27:44,949 --> 01:27:46,216
(and getting ready for an attack)

1709
01:27:46,216 --> 01:27:48,216
(The wailing wall is set.)

1710
01:27:49,949 --> 01:27:51,816
(Soft feint into the open spot)

1711
01:27:51,816 --> 01:27:52,816
From the center.

1712
01:27:52,816 --> 01:27:54,349
- Soft shot.
- Soft shot!

1713
01:27:54,349 --> 01:27:56,849
(The light feint strategy succeeded.)

1714
