Three players jumped all at once!

1715
01:28:03,549 --> 01:28:04,582
Su Bin,

1716
01:28:04,582 --> 01:28:07,249
you didn't know what they'd do
when you three all jumped together?

1717
01:28:08,449 --> 01:28:11,349
