1722
01:28:20,216 --> 01:28:24,216
Now, Shujitsu High shows irregular plays.

1723
01:28:25,572 --> 01:28:27,438
The score gap is two points,
with a score of 14 to 12.

1724
01:28:27,438 --> 01:28:29,638
(They closed in to a two-point gap.)

1725
01:28:32,072 --> 01:28:35,505
(The cheers came back to life.)

1726
