1728
01:28:45,405 --> 01:28:47,838
Block both sides.

1729
01:28:50,305 --> 01:28:51,238
Chae Rim, smash it!

1730
01:28:53,538 --> 01:28:54,672
Na Yeon sets the ball.

1731
01:28:54,672 --> 01:28:55,538
Spike!

1732
01:28:55,705 --> 01:28:57,205
But it's blocked!

1733
01:28:58,338 --> 01:28:59,472
Chae Rim!

1734
01:28:59,472 --> 01:29:02,072
Make a long spike.

1735
01:29:02,072 --> 01:29:02,975
(Get it?)

1736
01:29:04,057 --> 01:29:05,438
(Panting)

1737
01:29:05,438 --> 01:29:07,472
(Okay.)

1738
01:29:08,622 --> 01:29:12,456
(Consecutive points scored.)

1739
01:29:12,456 --> 01:29:15,022
Shujitsu High catches up
to within one point...

1740
01:29:15,022 --> 01:29:16,456
