1741
01:29:18,156 --> 01:29:21,689
(Let's go, Shujitsu!)

1742
01:29:22,489 --> 01:29:24,422
We must score a point here!

1743
01:29:25,156 --> 01:29:26,956
Mind the score!

1744
01:29:27,556 --> 01:29:30,189
(We must not allow the tie.)

1745
01:29:33,356 --> 01:29:34,489
Na Yeon sets it again.

1746
01:29:36,656 --> 01:29:38,089
It's a solo block!

1747
01:29:38,589 --> 01:29:40,322
(This is a chance.)

1748
01:29:41,122 --> 01:29:42,122
Spike.

1749
01:29:42,874 --> 01:29:44,989
They must not concede a point this easily.

1750
01:29:45,522 --> 01:29:46,589
Sorry.

1751
01:29:48,922 --> 01:29:51,589
The Wonder Dogs allowed the tie.

1752
01:29:52,256 --> 01:29:55,289
Chae Rim needs to keep it simple.

1753
01:29:55,289 --> 01:29:57,489
If she tries too hard
and goes for powerful hits,

1754
01:29:57,489 --> 01:29:59,789
