1755
01:30:02,022 --> 01:30:03,256
She's pretty exhausted.

1756
01:30:03,256 --> 01:30:05,422
She seems a bit worn out.

1757
01:30:07,889 --> 01:30:10,056
Let's get just one point.
Chae Rim, just hit it.

1758
01:30:11,889 --> 01:30:14,022
(Let's go at it in one go!)

1759
01:30:16,089 --> 01:30:18,989
(The intense third set)

1760
01:30:19,960 --> 01:30:23,827
(Take the momentum with just one point.)

1761
01:30:27,827 --> 01:30:28,794
Mine!

1762
01:30:30,194 --> 01:30:31,360
Block both sides.

1763
01:30:32,960 --> 01:30:34,460
(Following the coach's instructions,)

1764
01:30:35,694 --> 01:30:38,660
(the middle blocker is
already close to the net.)

1765
01:30:39,667 --> 01:30:42,367
(Libero positioned
for the straight direction)

1766
01:30:43,511 --> 01:30:46,278
(Defensive formation positioned
for the cross direction)

1767
01:30:47,194 --> 01:30:49,960
(Formidable Shujitsu High's defense)

1768
01:30:52,027 --> 01:30:53,894
She dug the ball up.

1769
01:30:56,894 --> 01:30:58,227
(Left! Uchida! Go! Right!)

1770
01:30:58,227 --> 01:30:59,394
Shujitsu High is...

1771
01:31:00,294 --> 01:31:01,660
