1772
01:31:03,760 --> 01:31:06,027
(Where will the ball go?)

1773
01:31:06,760 --> 01:31:07,860
(Chaotic)

1774
01:31:07,860 --> 01:31:08,960
It's confusing.

1775
01:31:11,994 --> 01:31:14,027
(They're fooled!)

1776
01:31:17,160 --> 01:31:17,994
A quick attack!

1777
01:31:18,394 --> 01:31:19,227
It's a success.

1778
01:31:19,227 --> 01:31:21,627
Shujitsu High successfully
turned the game around.

1779
01:31:21,627 --> 01:31:22,760
(Third set, Shujitsu High 15
: Wonder Dogs 14)

1780
01:31:23,827 --> 01:31:32,060
(We've taken the lead!)

1781
01:31:34,794 --> 01:31:38,327
(Before they knew it,)

1782
01:31:39,027 --> 01:31:42,460
(the opponents had taken
control of the game.)

1783
01:31:43,692 --> 01:31:45,159
(Third set, Shujitsu High 11
: Wonder Dogs 14)

1784
01:31:45,160 --> 01:31:46,126
(Third set, Shujitsu High 12
: Wonder Dogs 14)
(Third set, Shujitsu High 13
: Wonder Dogs 14)

1785
01:31:46,995 --> 01:31:47,828
(Third set, Shujitsu High 14
: Wonder Dogs 14)
(Third set, Shujitsu High 15
: Wonder Dogs 14)

1786
01:31:48,927 --> 01:31:50,660
It's all right.

1787
01:31:51,647 --> 01:31:55,680
(A blink-of-the-eye comeback)

1788
01:32:00,853 --> 01:32:06,553
(They've lost momentum.)

1789
01:32:06,554 --> 01:32:08,988
Shujitsu High overcomes
a three-point gap...

1790
01:32:09,094 --> 01:32:11,727
