1791
01:32:18,094 --> 01:32:23,727
Both sides of the opponents are open.

1792
01:32:24,394 --> 01:32:26,894
(Targeting both sides,)

1793
01:32:28,894 --> 01:32:34,227
(Shujitsu High keeps the momentum going.)

1794
01:32:35,260 --> 01:32:36,427
Shoot!

1795
01:32:36,427 --> 01:32:39,660
(Third set, Shujitsu High 16
: Wonder Dogs 16)

1796
01:32:43,594 --> 01:32:45,360
(Moving her hand quickly)

1797
01:32:49,960 --> 01:32:51,994
(A mysterious signal)

1798
01:32:51,994 --> 01:32:55,627
- Coach, two?
- I'm on my way.

1799
01:32:58,694 --> 01:33:00,394
