1800
01:33:00,394 --> 01:33:01,760
When Na Yeon moves up to the front row.

1801
01:33:03,327 --> 01:33:05,194
- Double change?
- No, not that.

1802
01:33:05,194 --> 01:33:07,394
- I'd go with a double change here.
- Should we?

1803
01:33:08,127 --> 01:33:10,394
- We can switch them, then.
- I got it.

1804
01:33:11,760 --> 01:33:13,660
(Instead of a setter,)

1805
